From 22a97da98a8d91021c63600250711adf4ccf11d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Megurowo <44724359+MeguMario@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Jan 2026 02:24:41 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Environment variable to force decorations from this plugin
 instead of using one from Qt (#89)

* Environment variable to force decorations from this plugin instead of one from upstream
---
 README.md                         | 5 +++++
 src/qadwaitadecorations.json      | 2 +-
 src/qadwaitadecorationsplugin.cpp | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index c8ece6c..8f045cf 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -23,6 +23,11 @@ It can be used by setting the QT_WAYLAND_DECORATION environment variable:
 export QT_WAYLAND_DECORATION=adwaita
 ```
 
+Newer version of Qt6 includes an implementation of this plugin. To force decorations from this plugin, set the QT_WAYLAND_DECORATION environment variable to the following value:
+```
+export QT_WAYLAND_DECORATION=qadwaitadecorations
+```
+
